        <div class="comment-item">
          <img src="https://yt3.ggpht.com/0XyRMYda5do1LYBG5oeEW8Ej0j_QdstpJBO5k0ncKnXxi8E2iTSe1IwihVrtqNBHSFpXbRjWjA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj" alt="avatar" class="c-avatar" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="c-body">
            <div class="c-author">
               <span class="company">@official_kimjaewon</span>
               <span class="author-name" style="margin-left: 4px; font-weight: 400;">· 방금 전</span>
            </div>
            <div class="c-text">
              이번 종목은 진짜 역대급이네요. 저도 소액 담가봤습니다. 공유 감사합니다!
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="comment-item">
